<title>NETHERLANDS: RODAMCO RETAIL H1 NET UP THREE PCT.</title>
<headline>RODAMCO RETAIL H1 NET UP THREE PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Aug 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    24.5  vs  23.8</p>
<p>Total result after revaluations 25.2  vs  28.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Rodamco Retail, the specialised property fund of the</p>
<p>Robeco Group investing in shops, reiterated it expected 1996/97</p>
<p>full-year profits to show a rise from last year's 47.4 million</p>
<p>guilders. Profit growth in the second half of the year is</p>
<p>expected to be slightly below first-half growth it said.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
